@@ -0,0 +1,39 @@
+# Feature: Policies (AI Administrator)
+
+## Purpose
+Company rules that decide if a tool may run during **Task execute**:
+
+| Effect | Meaning |
+|--------|---------|
+| `allow` | Tool may run without human gate |
+| `require_approval` | Creates approval; Manager/Owner decides |
+| `deny` | Blocked |
+
+**Default:** if no policy matches a tool, it is **denied**.
+
+## Who
+| Role | View policies | Create / edit |
+|------|---------------|---------------|
+| Owner | Yes | Yes |
+| AI Administrator | Yes | Yes (`policy.manage`) |
+| Manager | Often read | Usually no |
+| Reservation | No (nav hidden) | No |
+
+## Frontend
+- Nav **Policies** (`policy-management`)
+- Create form: name, effect, tool name, description
+- Suggested tools: `search_availability`, `send_quotation`, `create_reservation`
+- Developer console: **Policy Simulator** (dry-run)
+
+## Recommended starter policies (travel)
+1. `search_availability` → **allow** (read-only search)
+2. `send_quotation` → **require_approval** or allow per company preference
+3. `create_reservation` → **require_approval**
+
+## Backend
+- `GET /companies/{id}/policies`
+- `POST /companies/{id}/policies`
+- `POST /companies/{id}/policies/simulate` (developer / admin tooling)
+
+## After create
+Run Task **execute** or Policy Simulator to confirm ALLOW / APPROVAL / DENY.
